values ('bbbb0003-0000-4000-8000-000000000027', 'en', null, 'The Startup Pitch', 'Learn to pitch a startup the way founders do: tell a clear story, build a standard deck, deliver it with confidence, and handle the questions that follow. Topic coverage and the standard slide order are informed by the pitch deck article on Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. Every explanation, example, and exercise here is original prose written for this course.', null, 'foundations', 39, true, 'business', '{}')
